<span begin="00:13.650" end="00:14.300">Wilson</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.307" end="00:17.888"><span begin="00:14.307" end="00:14.527">She </span><span begin="00:14.527" end="00:14.641">told </span><span begin="00:14.641" end="00:14.898">me </span><span begin="00:14.898" end="00:15.112">that </span><span begin="00:15.112" end="00:15.369">she </span><span begin="00:15.369" end="00:15.594">loved </span><span begin="00:15.594" end="00:15.834">me </span><span begin="00:15.834" end="00:16.051">by </span><span begin="00:16.051" end="00:16.251">the </span><span begin="00:16.251" end="00:16.592">water </span><span begin="00:16.592" end="00:17.736">fountain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.888" end="00:21.503"><span begin="00:17.888" end="00:18.099">She </span><span begin="00:18.099" end="00:18.143">told </span><span begin="00:18.143" end="00:18.396">me </span><span begin="00:18.396" end="00:18.604">that </span><span begin="00:18.604" end="00:18.829">she </span><span begin="00:18.829" end="00:19.097">loved </span><span begin="00:19.097" end="00:19.262">me </span><span begin="00:19.262" end="00:19.510">and </span><span begin="00:19.510" end="00:19.742">she </span><span begin="00:19.742" end="00:20.118">didn't </span><span begin="00:20.118" end="00:20.575">love </span><span begin="00:20.575" end="00:21.062">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.503" end="00:25.041"><span begin="00:21.503" end="00:21.703">And </span><span begin="00:21.703" end="00:21.859">that </span><span begin="00:21.859" end="00:22.089">was </span><span begin="00:22.089" end="00:22.553">really </span><span begin="00:22.553" end="00:22.947">lovely </span><span begin="00:22.947" end="00:23.065">because </span><span begin="00:23.065" end="00:23.347">it </span><span begin="00:23.347" end="00:23.697">was </span><span begin="00:23.697" end="00:24.441">innocent</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.041" end="00:28.390"><span begin="00:25.041" end="00:25.240">But </span><span begin="00:25.240" end="00:25.451">now </span><span begin="00:25.451" end="00:25.653">she's </span><span begin="00:25.653" end="00:25.869">got </span><span begin="00:25.869" end="00:26.101">a </span><span begin="00:26.101" end="00:26.313">cup </span><span begin="00:26.313" end="00:26.550">with </span><span begin="00:26.550" end="00:26.898">something </span><span begin="00:26.898" end="00:27.306">else </span><span begin="00:27.306" end="00:27.852">in </span><span begin="00:27.852" end="00:28.212">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.390" end="00:32.324"><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:28.775">It's </span><span begin="00:28.775" end="00:29.166">getting </span><span begin="00:29.166" end="00:29.558">kind </span><span begin="00:29.558" end="00:29.758">of </span><span begin="00:29.758" end="00:30.136">blurry </span><span begin="00:30.136" end="00:30.361">at </span><span begin="00:30.361" end="00:30.608">a </span><span begin="00:30.608" end="00:30.976">quarter </span><span begin="00:30.976" end="00:31.376">past </span><span begin="00:31.376" end="00:31.792">ten</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.324" end="00:35.856"><span begin="00:32.324" end="00:32.516">And </span><span begin="00:32.516" end="00:32.574">he </span><span begin="00:32.574" end="00:32.783">was </span><span begin="00:32.783" end="00:32.958">in </span><span begin="00:32.958" end="00:33.168">a </span><span begin="00:33.168" end="00:33.677">hurry </span><span begin="00:33.677" end="00:33.901">to </span><span begin="00:33.901" end="00:34.096">be </span><span begin="00:34.096" end="00:34.536">touching </span><span begin="00:34.536" end="00:34.960">her </span><span begin="00:34.960" end="00:35.416">skin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.856" end="00:39.403"><span begin="00:35.856" end="00:36.056">She's </span><span begin="00:36.056" end="00:36.344">feeling </span><span begin="00:36.344" end="00:36.576">kind </span><span begin="00:36.576" end="00:36.804">of </span><span begin="00:36.804" end="00:37.202">dirty </span><span begin="00:37.202" end="00:37.414">when </span><span begin="00:37.414" end="00:37.678">she's </span><span begin="00:37.678" end="00:38.316">dancing </span><span begin="00:38.316" end="00:38.580">with </span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:39.020">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.403" end="00:42.528"><span begin="00:39.403" end="00:39.893">Forgetting </span><span begin="00:39.893" end="00:40.082">what </span><span begin="00:40.082" end="00:40.435">she </span><span begin="00:40.435" end="00:40.647">told </span><span begin="00:40.647" end="00:40.867">me </span><span begin="00:40.867" end="00:41.090">by </span><span begin="00:41.090" end="00:41.299">the </span><span begin="00:41.299" end="00:41.675">water </span><span begin="00:41.675" end="00:42.528">fountain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.528" end="00:46.732"><span begin="00:42.528" end="00:42.904">Now </span><span begin="00:42.904" end="00:43.128">he's </span><span begin="00:43.128" end="00:43.720">grabbing </span><span begin="00:43.720" end="00:43.944">her </span><span begin="00:43.944" end="00:44.482">hips </span><span begin="00:44.762" end="00:44.994">and </span><span begin="00:44.994" end="00:45.538">pulling </span><span begin="00:45.538" end="00:45.798">her </span><span begin="00:45.798" end="00:46.250">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.732" end="00:50.715"><span begin="00:46.732" end="00:47.252">Kissing </span><span begin="00:47.252" end="00:47.524">her </span><span begin="00:47.524" end="00:48.076">lips </span><span begin="00:48.335" end="00:48.532">and </span><span begin="00:48.532" end="00:49.308">whispering </span><span begin="00:49.308" end="00:49.724">in </span><span begin="00:49.724" end="00:50.244">her </span><span begin="00:50.244" end="00:50.715">ear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.715" end="00:53.754"><span begin="00:50.715" end="00:50.915">And </span><span begin="00:50.915" end="00:51.127">she </span><span begin="00:51.127" end="00:51.458">k