 begin="01:03.672" end="01:04.054">was </span><span begin="01:04.054" end="01:04.480">too </span><span begin="01:04.480" end="01:06.798">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.153" end="01:11.635"><span begin="01:07.153" end="01:07.321">I </span><span begin="01:07.321" end="01:07.681">was </span><span begin="01:07.681" end="01:07.865">too </span><span begin="01:07.865" end="01:10.912">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.635" end="01:15.237"><span begin="01:11.635" end="01:11.826">I </span><span begin="01:11.826" end="01:12.190">should've </span><span begin="01:12.190" end="01:12.406">built </span><span begin="01:12.406" end="01:12.654">a </span><span begin="01:12.654" end="01:13.123">home </span><span begin="01:13.123" end="01:13.337">with </span><span begin="01:13.337" end="01:13.529">a </span><span begin="01:13.529" end="01:14.149">fountain </span><span begin="01:14.149" end="01:14.397">for </span><span begin="01:14.397" end="01:14.949">us</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.237" end="01:18.492"><span begin="01:15.237" end="01:15.430">The </span><span begin="01:15.430" end="01:15.732">moment </span><span begin="01:15.732" end="01:15.949">that </span><span begin="01:15.949" end="01:16.218">she </span><span begin="01:16.218" end="01:16.434">told </span><span begin="01:16.434" end="01:16.899">me </span><span begin="01:16.899" end="01:17.124">that </span><span begin="01:17.124" end="01:17.339">she </span><span begin="01:17.339" end="01:17.851">was </span><span begin="01:17.851" end="01:18.067">in </span><span begin="01:18.067" end="01:18.492">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.492" end="01:21.402"><span begin="01:18.492" end="01:18.714">Too </span><span begin="01:18.714" end="01:21.176">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.402" end="01:25.243"><span begin="01:21.402" end="01:21.596">I </span><span begin="01:21.596" end="01:21.942">was </span><span begin="01:21.942" end="01:22.296">too </span><span begin="01:22.296" end="01: